{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/mammal\" title=\"mammal\">mammal</a> of the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/family\" title=\"family\">family</a> <span class=\"biota\" about=\"#mwt72\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Canidae#Translingual\" title=\"Canidae\">Canidae</a></span>:\n<ol><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li><li class=\"senseid\" id=\"English:_Q144\" data-lang=\"en\" data-id=\"Q144\" about=\"#mwt73\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"> The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/species\" title=\"species\">species</a> <span class=\"biota\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Canis_familiaris#Translingual\" title=\"Canis familiaris\"><i>Canis familiaris</i></a></span> (sometimes designated <span class=\"biota\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Canis_lupus_familiaris#Translingual\" title=\"Canis lupus familiaris\"><i>Canis lupus familiaris</i></a></span>), <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/domesticated\" title=\"domesticated\">domesticated</a> for thousands of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/years\" title=\"years\">years</a> and of highly variable appearance because of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/human\" title=\"human\">human</a> breeding.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"The <b>dog</b> barked all night long."}],"examples":["The <b>dog</b> barked all night long."]},{"definition":""},{"definition":"The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/species\" title=\"species\">species</a> <span class=\"biota\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Canis_familiaris#Translingual\" title=\"Canis familiaris\"><i>Canis familiaris</i></a></span> (sometimes designated <span class=\"biota\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Canis_lupus_familiaris#Translingual\" title=\"Canis lupus familiaris\"><i>Canis lupus familiaris</i></a></span>), <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/domesticated\" title=\"domesticated\">domesticated</a> for thousands of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/years\" title=\"years\">years</a> and of highly variable appearance because of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/human\" title=\"human\">human</a> breeding.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"The <b>dog</b> barked all night long."}],"examples":["The <b>dog</b> barked all night long."]},{"definition":""},{"definition":"Any member of the family Canidae, including domestic dogs, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/wolf\" title=\"wolf\">wolves</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/coyote\" title=\"coyote\">coyotes</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/jackal\" title=\"jackal\">jackals</a>, and their relatives ."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt86\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A male dog, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/wolf\" title=\"wolf\">wolf</a>, or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/fox\" title=\"fox\">fox</a>, as opposed to a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/bitch\" title=\"bitch\">bitch</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/vixen\" title=\"vixen\">vixen</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt89\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/meat\" title=\"meat\">meat</a> of this animal, eaten as food.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Did you know that they eat <b>dog</b> in parts of Asia<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span>"}],"examples":["Did you know that they eat <b>dog</b> in parts of Asia<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span>"]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt91\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A person:\n<ol><li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt92\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/dull\" title=\"dull\">dull</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/unattractive\" title=\"unattractive\">unattractive</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/girl\" title=\"girl\">girl</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/woman\" title=\"woman\">woman</a>.","parsedExa