ize\">criticize</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt243\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/divide\" title=\"divide\">divide</a> (a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/watch\" title=\"watch\">watch</a>) with a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/comrade\" title=\"comrade\">comrade</a>."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Adjective","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt288\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> Of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/inferior\" title=\"inferior\">inferior</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/quality\" title=\"quality\">quality</a>; very <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/bad\" title=\"bad\">bad</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"Oh man, this game is absolutely <b>dog</b><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">!</span>"}],"examples":["Oh man, this game is absolutely <b>dog</b><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">!</span>"]}]}],"af":[{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"Afrikaans","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\" about=\"#mwt308\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">alternative form of <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"af\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/dag#Afrikaans\" title=\"dag\">dag</a></i></span></span> (<span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\" about=\"#mwt309\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#preterite\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">preterite</a> of <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"af\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/dink#Afrikaans\" title=\"dink\">dink</a></i></span></span>)"}]}],"other":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"Australian Kriol","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\" about=\"#mwt312\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/dog#English\" class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\">dog</a></span>\n\n<span c